{
 "title": "Today",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Today",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c637",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And Alabama kept moving.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c638",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1997, Mercedes-Benz opened its first American",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c639",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "car factory in a small Alabama town called",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c640",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Vance.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c641",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then came Honda, Hyundai, Toyota, and Mazda.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c642",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Today, Alabama's factories can build more than a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c643",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "million cars a year.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c644",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The SUV in the parking lot outside?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c645",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "There's a real chance it was built here.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c646",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Oh, and remember Scottsboro?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c647",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1970, a man there started buying lost",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c648",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "luggage that nobody had ever claimed.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c649",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Today, when the airlines give up on a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c650",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "bag, it ends up at his family's store.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c651",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Unclaimed Baggage.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c652",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "About a million people a year drive to",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c653",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a small Alabama town to shop for strangers'",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c654",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "suitcases.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c655",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Laptops, wedding dresses, somebody's skis.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c656",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "If you ever lost a bag, it might",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c657",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "be on a shelf in Alabama right now.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c658",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Airbus builds passenger jets in Mobile, the city",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c659",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that still throws America's oldest Mardi Gras.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c660",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The little town that called itself the Watercress",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c661",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Capital is now Alabama's biggest city.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c662",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in 2025, the government announced that the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c663",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "military's Space Command headquarters would move to Huntsville,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c664",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "too.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c665",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 2019, researchers confirmed they had found the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c666",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "wreck of the Clotilda, buried in the mud",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c667",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "of the Mobile River.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c668",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The descendants of the people it carried still",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c669",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "live nearby, in a neighborhood their ancestors built",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c670",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "after the war.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c671",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It's called Africatown.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c672",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in April 2026, a new moon rocket",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c673",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "lifted off with four astronauts.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c674",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It was designed and managed at the Marshall",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c675",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Space Flight Center in Huntsville.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c676",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They flew around the moon and came home,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c677",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "farther from Earth than any human beings had",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c678",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "ever been.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c679",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Alabama sent people around the moon.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c680",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Again.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c681",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And on the ground?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c682",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Every autumn, half the state still stops talking",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c683",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "to the other half for one football game.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c684",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Alabama against Auburn.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c685",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They call it the Iron Bowl.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c686",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Of course they do.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c687",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Birmingham was built on iron.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c688",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So let's go back to that name.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c689",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Alabama.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c690",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Remember the newspaper that said it meant, here",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c691",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "we rest?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c692",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Nobody has ever found those words in the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c693",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "language.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c694",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The most common explanation is that it comes",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c695",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "from Choctaw words about clearing the land.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c696",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Clearing the thicket.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c697",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The people who clear the thicket.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c698",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Ten thousand years of people clearing a path",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c699",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "where there wasn't one.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c700",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "With a cave fire.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c701",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "With a peanut.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c702",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "With a rocket.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c703",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "With a bus seat.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c704",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "With a march across a bridge.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c705",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That is the entire history of Alabama.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c706",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Never here we rest.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c707",
     "shot": "todo_today",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Always clear the path.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}